514		For every admissible tuple $\mathsf{qldparams} = (q,m,d)$ (Definition~\ref{def:admissible}), the Pauli basis test $\mathfrak{G}^{\mathrm{Pauli}}_{\mathsf{qldparams}}$ has a value-$1$ SPCC strategy.
